# Large flow reference assets — keep in a shared store / Git LFS, not the repo.
# The DERIVED text (flow-annotations.md, transcribed flow maps, *.cases.yaml) IS committed.
knowledge/flows/**/*.png
knowledge/flows/**/*.webp
knowledge/flows/**/*.jpg
knowledge/flows/**/*.jpeg
knowledge/flows/**/*.zip
knowledge/bos/**/*.png
knowledge/bos/**/*.webp
